H('407.d.5.D',3,"Criteria for a stormwater basin design might include cost, safety, and:","how well it holds water",["the designer's age","day of the week","rainbow colors"],"Criteria are measurable qualities of success.")
H('407.d.5.D',4,"Listing criteria before choosing among designs allows a team to:","judge each option fairly",["avoid choosing","guess","skip testing"],"Common criteria make comparison fair.")
