H('407.d.9.J',4,"Adding chlorine to kill germs in drinking water is an example of a:","chemical process",["physical process","biological process","magnetic process"],"Disinfection uses chemicals.")
H('407.d.9.K',3,"Plants take up nitrates from contaminated water through their:","roots",["flowers","fruit","seeds only"],"Roots absorb dissolved nutrients.")
