H('408.d.11.B',3,"For fluids with the same stiffness, a denser fluid generally has a speed of sound that is:","lower",["higher","infinite","zero"],"Speed of sound is sqrt(stiffness / density).")
H('408.d.11.B',4,"The speed of sound in air is about 343 m/s, and in water about 1,480 m/s, because water is much:","less compressible",["more compressible","lighter","colder"],"Stiffer fluids carry sound faster.")
